      "name": "top_p_filter",
      "part": 0,
      "points": 5,
      "signature": "top_p_filter(logits, p)",
      "doc": "Nucleus filtering: keep the smallest set of tokens whose cumulative\nprobability reaches ``p``; set the rest to -inf."
